  "prefLabel": "He-C 1550.01 Purpose and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 1550.01 Purpose and Scope. This part contains the requirements for the submission of health care facility financial information from nursing homes, acute care hospitals, residential care facilities, specialty hospitals, or other health care facilities licensed under RSA 151.\n\nSource. # 9781, eff 1-1-11, EXPIRED: 1-1-19\n\nNew. #12723, INTERIM, eff 2-14-19, EXPIRES: 8-13-19",
